1
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,348
[HOST] In late 1971, in the
affluent suburban town of Westfield,

2
00:00:26,348 --> 00:00:30,400
New Jersey, an unsettling silence
fell over the Breeze Knoll mansion.

3
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:33,959
It was an imposing nineteen-room
Victorian residence,

4
00:00:33,959 --> 00:00:37,670
home to the meticulous and devout
accountant John List and his family.

5
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:40,851
For nearly an entire
month starting November 9,

6
00:00:40,851 --> 00:00:44,420
lights throughout the grand house
remained illuminated day and night.

7
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:46,667
Through bitter winter nights,

8
00:00:46,667 --> 00:00:49,920
somber religious organ hymns
played continuously from within,

9
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:52,480
yet not a single resident
was ever seen outside.

10
00:00:53,230 --> 00:00:56,413
Neighbors noticed only unopened
mail and daily newspapers

11
00:00:56,413 --> 00:00:59,150
slowly piling up on the
snow-covered front porch.

12
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:02,446
The historic mansion seemed
utterly frozen in time,

13
00:01:02,446 --> 00:01:06,140
completely detached from the bustling
rhythm of the surrounding community.

14
00:01:06,890 --> 00:01:10,302
The prolonged and inexplicable
disappearance of five members of a model

15
00:01:10,302 --> 00:01:13,570
Christian household stirred deep
unease throughout the neighborhood.

16
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:17,935
A chilling dread quietly settled into
the minds of those who knew them,

17
00:01:17,935 --> 00:01:21,040
foreshadowing a horrific reality
waiting behind locked doors.

18
00:01:22,390 --> 00:01:22,946
[HOST] For years,

19
00:01:22,946 --> 00:01:26,060
the List family had been
admired across Westfield as the

20
00:01:26,060 --> 00:01:29,230
very embodiment of the
respectable suburban middle class.

21
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:34,477
The forty-six-year-old patriarch, John
List, was a World War II army veteran,

22
00:01:34,477 --> 00:01:38,740
a diligent accountant, and a respected
bank vice president in New Jersey.

23
00:01:39,490 --> 00:01:42,549
He was never seen without a
crisp conservative suit and tie,

24
00:01:42,549 --> 00:01:46,730
faithfully serving as church council
treasurer at the local Lutheran congregation.

25
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:51,614
Living together in the sprawling residence
were his forty-five-year-old wife Helen,

26
00:01:51,614 --> 00:01:55,000
his eighty-four-year-old mother
Alma, and three school-age children.

27
00:01:55,750 --> 00:01:57,990
In the eyes of neighbors and colleagues,

28
00:01:57,990 --> 00:02:01,630
they represented an ideal household
endowed with social standing,

29
00:02:01,630 --> 00:02:03,590
moral rectitude, and genuine piety.

30
00:02:04,340 --> 00:02:08,841
Yet, that very facade of absolute propriety
generated a formidable “Halo Effect”,

31
00:02:08,841 --> 00:02:12,620
blinding the surrounding community
to any dark suspicions for years.

32
00:02:13,370 --> 00:02:17,210
People simply refused to believe that
an impeccably polite gentleman who

33
00:02:17,210 --> 00:02:21,050
greeted everyone warmly at church
could harbor destructive mental rifts.

34
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:24,172
When early warning signs quietly surfaced,

35
00:02:24,172 --> 00:02:28,520
collective normalcy bias led society to
discount the most critical red flags.

36
00:02:29,870 --> 00:02:33,300
[HOST] Beneath the grandeur of the
Breeze Knoll estate lay a suffocating

37
00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:36,150
financial nightmare spiraling
entirely out of control.

38
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:38,201
In the summer of 1971,

39
00:02:38,201 --> 00:02:42,106
John List was abruptly dismissed
from his bank executive position,

40
00:02:42,106 --> 00:02:45,300
destroying the sole income
keeping the mansion afloat.

41
00:02:46,050 --> 00:02:49,344
Rather than facing reality and
confiding in his loved ones,

42
00:02:49,344 --> 00:02:51,801
an overwhelming terror
of social humiliation

43
00:02:51,801 --> 00:02:54,090
triggered a compulsive pattern of deceit.

44
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:58,167
Every morning, he dressed in his
suit, picked up his briefcase,

45
00:02:58,167 --> 00:02:59,540
and left home on schedule,

46
00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:02,920
only to spend whole days reading
newspapers at railway stations.

47
00:03:03,670 --> 00:03:05,442
To fund this elaborate masquerade,

48
00:03:05,442 --> 00:03:08,100
List secretly embezzled
nearly two hundred thousand

49
00:03:08,100 --> 00:03:11,070
dollars from the savings and
bonds of his elderly mother.

50
00:03:11,820 --> 00:03:15,281
By early November 1971, those
drained funds were exhausted,

51
00:03:15,281 --> 00:03:19,740
and foreclosure notices on the mortgaged
estate began arriving relentlessly.

52
00:03:20,490 --> 00:03:22,465
Pushed into a psychological corner,

53
00:03:22,465 --> 00:03:25,174
a ruthless plan took
definitive shape inside the

54
00:03:25,174 --> 00:03:27,770
rigid mind of the
control-obsessed accountant.

55
00:03:29,070 --> 00:03:33,120
[TEACHER] Picture the suffocating
atmosphere and profound dread felt by those

56
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:37,110
of us who knew young Patricia List
during the late autumn of 1971.

57
00:03:38,060 --> 00:03:40,713
Patricia was sixteen, a bright, sensitive,

58
00:03:40,713 --> 00:03:43,493
talented student
possessing an extraordinary

59
00:03:43,493 --> 00:03:46,020
passion for dramatic theater and acting.

60
00:03:46,970 --> 00:03:49,726
In the eyes of her rigidly
authoritarian father,

61
00:03:49,726 --> 00:03:52,597
acting in school plays and
embracing youth culture

62
00:03:52,597 --> 00:03:55,410
was viewed as sinful
rebellion beyond redemption.

63
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,300
Several weeks before the tragedy,

64
00:03:58,300 --> 00:04:01,063
Patricia confided in me
through tears that life

65
00:04:01,063 --> 00:04:04,120
inside that cavernous mansion
had become unbearable.

66
00:04:05,070 --> 00:04:07,569
She whispered words that
chilled my very soul:

67
00:04:07,569 --> 00:04:11,590
“I am terrified my father is going to
do something terrible to all of us.”

68
00:04:12,540 --> 00:04:15,897
When all three List children
suddenly stopped attending classes,

69
00:04:15,897 --> 00:04:18,835
school administrators received
only a brief written note

70
00:04:18,835 --> 00:04:22,140
claiming they had traveled south
to tend to a sick grandmother.

71
00:04:23,090 --> 00:04:26,881
Whenever I walked past Breeze
Knoll on freezing winter evenings,

72
00:04:26,881 --> 00:04:30,257
seeing those lonely lights
and hearing faint organ hymns,

73
00:04:30,257 --> 00:04:32,330
a sick premonition seized my chest.

74
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:34,554
For decades afterward,

75
00:04:34,554 --> 00:04:37,508
that desperate cry from my
young student haunted me

76
00:04:37,508 --> 00:04:40,520
like an agonizing grief
that could never find peace.

77
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:45,567
[HOST] The mounting alarm of teachers
and neighbors finally reached a boiling

78
00:04:45,567 --> 00:04:48,580
point after nearly four weeks of
utter silence from the estate.

79
00:04:49,330 --> 00:04:51,619
On the evening of December 7, 1971,

80
00:04:51,619 --> 00:04:56,850
Westfield police officers pried open an
unlatched basement window to gain entry.

81
00:04:57,600 --> 00:05:00,865
A gust of freezing, tomb-like air
hit the patrolmen immediately,

82
00:05:00,865 --> 00:05:04,640
as the central heating system had been
deliberately shut off weeks before.

83
00:05:05,390 --> 00:05:07,942
The darkened mansion smelled
of freezing dampness,

84
00:05:07,942 --> 00:05:12,230
accompanied by the monotonous hum of an
automated stereo playing sacred organ hymns.

85
00:05:12,980 --> 00:05:15,946
Making their way into the
cavernous first-floor ballroom,

86
00:05:15,946 --> 00:05:19,900
officers stopped dead in their tracks
before a scene of unfathomable sorrow.

87
00:05:20,650 --> 00:05:24,172
Four family members, the mother
Helen and the three children,

88
00:05:24,172 --> 00:05:27,810
lay arranged side by side in neat
alignment upon sleeping bags.

89
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,151
High above their resting place,

90
00:05:30,151 --> 00:05:33,589
an exquisite Tiffany stained-glass
skylight filtered cold moonlight

91
00:05:33,589 --> 00:05:36,720
onto one of the darkest family
tragedies in American history.

92
00:05:38,020 --> 00:05:41,253
[INVESTIGATOR] Forensic examinations
confirmed that all victims

93
00:05:41,253 --> 00:05:44,284
had been systematically
killed on November 9,

94
00:05:44,284 --> 00:05:47,180
1971, nearly a full
month before discovery.

95
00:05:47,930 --> 00:05:51,572
The perpetrator meticulously
executed the killings sequentially

96
00:05:51,572 --> 00:05:55,330
throughout that single day to
prevent any coordinated resistance.

97
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:58,844
In an upstairs third-floor
attic apartment,

98
00:05:58,844 --> 00:06:03,600
investigators located the deceased
eighty-four-year-old mother, Alma List.

99
00:06:04,350 --> 00:06:08,780
The geometric alignment of the bodies
inside the grand ballroom unmistakably

100
00:06:08,780 --> 00:06:12,510
reflected the rigid order and
ritualistic mindset of the killer.

101
00:06:13,260 --> 00:06:14,277
On his study desk,

102
00:06:14,277 --> 00:06:16,934
detectives recovered an
extraordinary five-page

103
00:06:16,934 --> 00:06:19,364
handwritten letter
addressed to his pastor,

104
00:06:19,364 --> 00:06:21,060
the Reverend Eugene Rehwinkel.

105
00:06:21,810 --> 00:06:22,806
In that document,

106
00:06:22,806 --> 00:06:26,558
John List coldly argued that he
ended their lives to “send their

107
00:06:26,558 --> 00:06:30,250
souls to heaven” before poverty
and moral decay corrupted them.

108
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:34,886
The confession concluded with a
chilling theological rationale:

109
00:06:34,886 --> 00:06:39,760
he had to remain alive to seek eventual
divine absolution before his own death.

110
00:06:41,060 --> 00:06:44,449
[HOST] That confession letter was
not merely a cold admission of guilt,

111
00:06:44,449 --> 00:06:48,420
but a terrifying display of pathological
delusion disguised as benevolence.

112
00:06:49,170 --> 00:06:51,440
Having annihilated his entire household,

113
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:53,993
this meticulous accountant
executed an escape

114
00:06:53,993 --> 00:06:56,490
plan engineered down
to the smallest detail.

115
00:06:57,240 --> 00:07:00,379
Investigators realized with
sinking hearts that the killer

116
00:07:00,379 --> 00:07:03,680
held an uncontested four-week
head start to erase his tracks.

117
00:07:04,380 --> 00:07:08,111
A massive nationwide manhunt
involving local authorities and

118
00:07:08,111 --> 00:07:11,780
the FBI was immediately unleashed
across the United States.

119
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:15,477
Yet nobody could have foreseen
that the specter named John

120
00:07:15,477 --> 00:07:18,680
List would vanish without a trace
for nearly two full decades.

121
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:24,176
[HOST] As soon as the
catastrophic crime was uncovered,

122
00:07:24,176 --> 00:07:26,776
detectives immediately
searched all nineteen rooms

123
00:07:26,776 --> 00:07:29,480
to secure identification
photographs of the suspect.

124
00:07:30,230 --> 00:07:30,662
Instead,

125
00:07:30,662 --> 00:07:34,007
investigators encountered a
profoundly chilling spectacle that

126
00:07:34,007 --> 00:07:37,190
revealed the sheer calculating
coldness of the perpetrator.

127
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:40,519
Every single family photo
album, framed portrait,

128
00:07:40,519 --> 00:07:44,940
and keepsake certificate throughout the
residence had been systematically ransacked.

129
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:48,546
The face of John List had
been painstakingly excised and

130
00:07:48,546 --> 00:07:51,400
was completely missing from
every available photograph.

131
00:07:52,100 --> 00:07:55,307
The killer had taken a pair of sharp
shears to deliberately erase his

132
00:07:55,307 --> 00:07:58,700
physical existence from the visual
history of the Breeze Knoll household.

133
00:08:00,050 --> 00:08:02,705
[HOST] Excising his visage
from family albums was not

134
00:08:02,705 --> 00:08:05,302
merely a tactical maneuver
to thwart pursuit,

135
00:08:05,302 --> 00:08:08,650
but a powerful psychological
act of symbolic annihilation.

136
00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:13,075
It represented a deliberate ritual
to extinguish the social identity

137
00:08:13,075 --> 00:08:16,480
of John List before assuming an
entirely new persona elsewhere.

138
00:08:17,230 --> 00:08:19,848
Before locking the heavy
front doors behind him,

139
00:08:19,848 --> 00:08:23,230
List executed an astonishingly
coordinated deception protocol.

140
00:08:23,930 --> 00:08:27,646
He contacted local schools directly
with written notes granting his three

141
00:08:27,646 --> 00:08:31,210
children extended leaves of absence
to visit family in North Carolina.

142
00:08:31,910 --> 00:08:35,508
He contacted suppliers to
suspend all home milk deliveries,

143
00:08:35,508 --> 00:08:38,070
daily newspapers, and routine postal mail.

144
00:08:38,770 --> 00:08:42,291
He left an automated radio
receiver tuned to a local station,

145
00:08:42,291 --> 00:08:46,850
broadcasting solemn hymns continuously
to simulate ordinary household presence.

146
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:50,689
The central heating thermostats
were turned down to freezing

147
00:08:50,689 --> 00:08:53,520
levels to drastically decelerate
natural decomposition.

148
00:08:54,270 --> 00:08:56,788
His family automobile was
subsequently discovered

149
00:08:56,788 --> 00:08:59,615
abandoned at Kennedy
International Airport in New York,

150
00:08:59,615 --> 00:09:02,750
deliberately staging an illusion
of commercial flight escape.

151
00:09:04,450 --> 00:09:07,585
[INVESTIGATOR] Locating the vehicle
at Kennedy Airport initially appeared

152
00:09:07,585 --> 00:09:10,450
to offer a decisive breakthrough
for law enforcement.

153
00:09:11,150 --> 00:09:11,640
However,

154
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:15,806
exhaustive cross-referencing of
passenger manifests across thousands

155
00:09:15,806 --> 00:09:19,910
of domestic and foreign flights
yielded zero matches for John List.

156
00:09:20,660 --> 00:09:24,665
FBI behavioral agents swiftly
deduced that the abandoned car was

157
00:09:24,665 --> 00:09:28,420
an intentional smoke screen
designed to misdirect resources.

158
00:09:29,170 --> 00:09:29,730
In truth,

159
00:09:29,730 --> 00:09:34,400
List boarded a long-distance passenger
train out of New York that very day,

160
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,890
slipping deep into the American Midwest.

161
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:40,996
His staggering four-week head
start permitted him to sever

162
00:09:40,996 --> 00:09:44,120
all forensic ties to his
initial movements completely.

163
00:09:44,870 --> 00:09:48,809
Federal fugitive warrants were
disseminated across all fifty states,

164
00:09:48,809 --> 00:09:53,270
yet the investigation rapidly descended
into a total investigative stalemate.

165
00:09:54,020 --> 00:09:57,132
The suspect seemed to have
evaporated into thin air,

166
00:09:57,132 --> 00:10:01,500
leaving no financial footprints, credit
trails, or communications behind.

167
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,380
[HOST] In subsequent years,

168
00:10:04,380 --> 00:10:07,329
the Breeze Knoll massacre
ossified into a haunting

169
00:10:07,329 --> 00:10:10,160
urban legend casting a
shadow over Union County.

170
00:10:10,910 --> 00:10:16,079
In August 1972, the vacant estate was
entirely destroyed by a suspicious arson fire,

171
00:10:16,079 --> 00:10:19,710
incinerating the magnificent
Tiffany glass ceiling forever.

172
00:10:20,460 --> 00:10:22,116
Alongside the mansion ashes,

173
00:10:22,116 --> 00:10:25,428
the scarce black-and-white
portraits of John List on FBI

174
00:10:25,428 --> 00:10:28,740
wanted posters gradually
yellowed and decayed with time.

175
00:10:29,490 --> 00:10:33,119
Authorities fielded thousands of
civilian tips and reported sightings,

176
00:10:33,119 --> 00:10:35,970
yet every single lead dead-ended
in bitter frustration.

177
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:40,050
The community remained trapped
in an enduring collective unease,

178
00:10:40,050 --> 00:10:43,120
wondering whether justice would
ever overtake the fugitive.

179
00:10:43,870 --> 00:10:47,420
Citizens struggled to comprehend how
a man who extinguished five family

180
00:10:47,420 --> 00:10:50,670
members could walk freely beneath
the open sky for so many years.

181
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:54,672
The relentless passage of time
stood as an agonizing indictment

182
00:10:54,672 --> 00:10:57,460
of law enforcement perseverance
and public conscience.

183
00:10:58,760 --> 00:11:01,149
[INVESTIGATOR] Throughout
eighteen agonizing years,

184
00:11:01,149 --> 00:11:04,135
the case file marked
John Emil List was never

185
00:11:04,135 --> 00:11:07,520
closed on the desks of
Westfield police detectives.

186
00:11:08,270 --> 00:11:10,982
Generations of seasoned
investigators shared an

187
00:11:10,982 --> 00:11:14,270
unwavering behavioral conviction
regarding this fugitive.

188
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:19,065
We believed that a personality as
compulsively rigid and conservative

189
00:11:19,065 --> 00:11:22,700
as List could never alter his
fundamental behavioral patterns.

190
00:11:23,450 --> 00:11:28,080
He had to be hiding beneath an assumed
identity in some peaceful community,

191
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:31,970
quietly balancing ledgers and
attending Sunday church services.

192
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:36,521
The insurmountable crux of the
problem was anticipating what his

193
00:11:36,521 --> 00:11:40,560
physical face looked like after
nearly two decades of natural aging.

194
00:11:41,310 --> 00:11:45,181
It represented a complex forensic
riddle extending far beyond the

195
00:11:45,181 --> 00:11:49,230
capabilities of conventional law
enforcement techniques at the time.

196
00:11:50,530 --> 00:11:54,590
[HOST] Only in the late 1980s did an
extraordinary confluence of forensic sculpture

197
00:11:54,590 --> 00:11:58,170
and mass television broadcasting
unlock an unexpected breakthrough.

198
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:01,320
Yet before recounting
that historic capture,

199
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:04,920
we must dissect the dark and
paradoxical inner world of John List.

200
00:12:05,670 --> 00:12:08,775
What drove a conscientious
accountant and devout churchgoer

201
00:12:08,775 --> 00:12:11,670
with zero criminal record to
obliterate his own family?

202
00:12:12,770 --> 00:12:16,036
Did this horrific act stem
from sudden psychotic madness,

203
00:12:16,036 --> 00:12:18,900
or was it the inexorable
outcome of a pathological

204
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:21,650
personality structure
distorted by rigid belief?

205
00:12:22,750 --> 00:12:26,797
Modern forensic behavioral analysts
found compelling answers within

206
00:12:26,797 --> 00:12:31,024
the diagnostic framework of
Obsessive-Compulsive Personality Disorder,

207
00:12:31,024 --> 00:12:31,870
known as OCPD.

208
00:12:32,620 --> 00:12:36,133
Intertwined with that condition
was a dangerous cognitive snare:

209
00:12:36,133 --> 00:12:40,140
the psychological neutralization
technique appealing to higher loyalties.

210
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:44,806
These mechanisms transformed a horrific
crime into an act the perpetrator

211
00:12:44,806 --> 00:12:48,880
genuinely believed he was divinely
mandated to execute to save his victims.

212
00:12:49,630 --> 00:12:51,957
Let us join our Psychologist
to peel back the

213
00:12:51,957 --> 00:12:54,750
psychological layers beneath
the Breeze Knoll tragedy.

214
00:12:57,750 --> 00:12:59,916
[HOST] In modern
criminological typologies,

215
00:12:59,916 --> 00:13:02,864
John List is classified
among family annihilators

216
00:13:02,864 --> 00:13:05,030
driven by pseudo-altruistic motives.

217
00:13:05,780 --> 00:13:08,283
This diagnostic term
designates perpetrators who

218
00:13:08,283 --> 00:13:10,943
destroy their families not
out of spontaneous rage,

219
00:13:10,943 --> 00:13:15,220
but from a pathological conviction that
they are sparing them an intolerable fate.

220
00:13:15,970 --> 00:13:18,226
To decipher this distorted reasoning,

221
00:13:18,226 --> 00:13:21,579
FBI behavioral profilers
applied the clinical framework

222
00:13:21,579 --> 00:13:24,322
of Obsessive-Compulsive
Personality Disorder,

223
00:13:24,322 --> 00:13:24,810
or OCPD.

224
00:13:25,560 --> 00:13:27,514
It is vital to distinguish OCPD,

225
00:13:27,514 --> 00:13:31,971
an overarching personality structure
shaping a person's entire worldview,

226
00:13:31,971 --> 00:13:36,000
from standard obsessive-compulsive
anxiety disorder, known as OCD.

227
00:13:36,750 --> 00:13:39,592
Whereas individuals
suffering from OCD recognize

228
00:13:39,592 --> 00:13:42,316
the irrationality of
their intrusive impulses,

229
00:13:42,316 --> 00:13:47,230
those with OCPD rigidly believe their
conduct represents absolute moral perfection.

230
00:13:47,980 --> 00:13:51,674
It was this unyielding conviction
of righteousness that led John List

231
00:13:51,674 --> 00:13:55,260
into a fatal psychological labyrinth
with no possibility of escape.

232
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:59,439
